      "id": "cet4:2022-06-03:p:b-1-4",
      "paperId": "cet4:2022-06-03",
      "kind": "instruction",
      "sourceText": "Directions: Suppose you are going to write a proposal to your school clinic for improving its service. You are to write about its current problems and possible solutions to these problems. You will have 30 minutes to write the proposal. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.",
      "sourceHash": "893da16820eee4aee8409ac08a8556379e498d0b67b43e2cb646a6d92fd11e30",
      "sourceBlockIds": [
        "cet4:2022-06-03:b-1-4"
      ],
      "reflowBlockIds": [
        "cet4:2022-06-03:b-1-4"
      ],
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "translationEligible": true,
      "translationZh": "说明：假设您要向学校诊所写一份改善其服务的提案。你要写出它当前的问题以及这些问题的可能解决方案。您将有 30 分钟的时间来撰写提案。您应该写至少 120 个字但不超过 180 个字。",
